  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 minutes. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6811859f5917498f8bf2dade/step-d5698c00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, finely chop garlic.\n• In a large bowl, combine a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Add slaw mix. Toss to combine and set aside.\n• In a small bowl, combine oyster sauce, ginger paste, garlic, the brown sugar, soy sauce and water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6811859f5917498f8bf2dade/step-72fa4010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add oyster sauce mixture and cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6811859f5917498f8bf2dade/step-5b2c5a20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice between bowls.\n• Top with Vietnamese caramelised tofu and rainbow slaw.\n• Sprinkle over crushed peanuts and top with a dollop of garlic aioli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6811859f5917498f8bf2dade/step-0faf9630.jpg"
    }
  ]
